l substances to reduce access","timescale":null}]},{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2023-0534-Response-from-DSIT.pdf","filename":"2023-0534-Response-from-DSIT.pdf","promises":[{"id":1030,"quote":"The act's illegal safety duties will apply to all in-scope 'user-to-user' services which allow users to post content online, or to interact with each other - including online forums. This means that once these duties are in force, they will be required to have systems and processes in place to proactively prevent users from encountering priority illegal content via their service and to minimise the length of time for which such content is present.","summary":"User-to-user services must implement systems to proactively prevent users from encountering priority illegal content and minimise its duration.","timescale":"once these duties are in force"}]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/kimberley-liu-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Kimberley Liu: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2023-12-21","coroner":"Ian Potter","area":"Inner North London","ref":"2023-0544","categories":["Alcohol, drug and medication related deaths","Alcohol, drugs medication related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2023-0544-Response-from-Department-of-Health-and-Social-Care.pdf","filename":"2023-0544-Response-from-Department-of-Health-and-Social-Care.pdf","promises":[{"id":2001,"quote":"The MHRA has a dedicated Criminal Enforcement Unit (CEU) that works with partners across government and policing to prevent and disrupt this illegal trade and to bring to justice those involved.","summary":"MHRA will investigate and prosecute illegal online drug sales","timescale":null}]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/deborah-cooper-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Deborah Cooper: Prevention of future deaths report (1)","date":"2024